{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:43b5b5701ce1c0769e796691e8c966245a1ec55819603d216c2e3c36affd0993",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abff5a8635ee2ab8ee657b023c3cd2690883f479c9fef8f7ad6ae37d90cdcb5",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n现在方便聊会儿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a2d127020c5efd41ade135b6b59d2a4e04673d365ad585c22b05608e3fe2e42",
      "text": "派对……真的超级开心的呢。\n我现在整个人都还轻飘飘的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:529f5b7ef394773aca37727f80943923a1427158fae35307dc37cc363e80fbc0",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也帮忙准备了\n派对对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f4326dd3758d2dce6acdfc5bd73796c47ef99eef56bfd543360de90102e2563",
      "text": "我只是稍微\n帮了点忙而已",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6956b600f9522bcfeb9bbefb2f7111f9e77eab3b41c9d8164225c25fd44b8af",
      "text": "就算是那样，帮了忙这点\n也是事实吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5480b62932354d2cbb8f2f9b8d6460830f748c4c5f66fb09a5a49b5bb783eee9",
      "text": "居然为了我\n做到那个地步……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ad36b8d6207870ec85ae2b5a293bc631a8460482ec3507d5df61339789e54ec",
      "text": "今天我还收到了大家赠送的\n名为“回忆”的礼物哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc0dc90dea4da2388f98f0662355b5de89ffd7f90183a31a4e85e720b61534be",
      "text": "等到了大家的生日，\n我也要全力去筹备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ccc87d6ec757f02e4dfd3512eca778e5fa9324e9f0513ac5e3e64e21f267806",
      "text": "当然，到了●●●●プロデューサー的生日，\n我也一定会打起精神好好为你庆祝的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be3ee8e1509a17dd1e06dd8dd9f3017e3a4e23085dc53d2c7ebe0fbb349f5836",
      "text": "……啊，说出来就称不上惊喜了嘛。\n啊哈哈，刚才那句请忘掉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_22_t01:1_2_020_22_t01:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd66fce96a2271b32c6249746f6816b11c973c91648935a52c7be8af941c04d6",
      "text": "总之今天真的太谢谢你了！\n那就回见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
